description:
Checks a draft card spec and runs it over the person's Health data, without saving anything: start here to make a card. If the spec has errors, the call fails listing every one with its path and how to fix it; otherwise it returns the canonical spec and the data the card would show. Fix and preview again until it's right, then create_card (or update_card) with the spec.

A card spec is JSON. Only version (1, or 2 for a workout window's location), display.name and each series' type are required: leave the rest out for their defaults. Outputs give the canonical form, every default filled in, at the lowest version that has what it uses.
- display: name (1-40 characters), symbol (one of the schema's SF Symbols; default the type's), color (red, orange, yellow, green, mint, teal, cyan, blue, indigo, purple, pink, brown, gray; default the type's), unit (e.g. kg, lb, degF, km; null for the person's locale).
- series: 1 to 4, sharing one axis, so one unit. Each is a quantity type (an identifier, or a name such as "Heart Rate": list_types and search find them) and an aggregation per bucket (sum, avg, min, max, first, latest, count): types that add up (steps, energy, distance) take sum only, others avg (the default), min, max, first, latest or count. Optional: id (a, b, c, d by default), label, hidden.
- window, for types that don't add up, keeps readings that start in it: {"kind": "asleep"}, {"kind": "beforeSleep", "minutes": 5} or {"kind": "afterWaking", "minutes": 30} (1-240 minutes, around each night's main sleep), {"kind": "workout", "activities": [37]} (HKWorkoutActivityType values or names; null for every workout; with version 2, "location": "indoor" or "outdoor" keeps only workouts the workouts tool's indoor says were there, leaving out those that don't say, e.g. {"kind": "workout", "activities": ["Running"], "location": "outdoor"} for outdoor runs), {"kind": "timeOfDay", "from": "00:00", "to": "12:00"} (the local clock; may cross midnight). filter: {"sources": [bundle IDs], "deviceModels": ["Watch"]}.
- bucket, what one point covers (auto, hour, day, night, week, month): auto (the default) is hours at D, days at W and M, weeks at 6M and months at Y. hour takes ranges D and W; day W, M, 6M and Y; week M, 6M and Y; month 6M and Y; night (a point per night) any, and needs a series with a sleep window. Sleep windows need night, week or month.
- range, the period it opens on (D, W, M, 6M, Y): a calendar day, week, month, six months or year. Default W, or the bucket's first.
- formulas, up to 2: {"kind": "movingAverage", "of": "a", "points": 7} (2-30 points) or {"kind": "difference", "of": ["a", "b"]} (a minus b). Hide a series to show only a formula.
- chart: style (bars, ranges, dots, line; default the type's), goal ({"value": 10000}, in the lead series' unit).
Examples:
- body temperature as a line: {"version":1,"display":{"name":"Body Temperature","symbol":"thermometer.medium","color":"red"},"series":[{"type":"BodyTemperature"}],"range":"M","chart":{"style":"line"}}
- heart rate while asleep, per night: {"version":1,"display":{"name":"Sleeping Heart Rate","symbol":"moon.zzz.fill","color":"indigo"},"series":[{"type":"HeartRate","window":{"kind":"asleep"}}],"bucket":"night","range":"M","chart":{"style":"line"}}
- HRV as dots, with a 7-point moving average: {"version":1,"display":{"name":"HRV","symbol":"waveform.path.ecg","color":"pink"},"series":[{"type":"HeartRateVariabilitySDNN"}],"formulas":[{"id":"trend","kind":"movingAverage","of":"a","points":7}],"range":"M","chart":{"style":"dots"}}
- heart rate in the 5 minutes before falling asleep, per night: {"version":1,"display":{"name":"Heart Rate Before Sleep","symbol":"bed.double.fill","color":"mint"},"series":[{"type":"Heart Rate","window":{"kind":"beforeSleep","minutes":5}}],"bucket":"night","range":"M","chart":{"style":"dots"}}
- the first weigh-in each day before noon, with a 7-day rolling average: {"version":1,"display":{"name":"Morning Weight","symbol":"scalemass.fill","color":"purple"},"series":[{"type":"BodyMass","aggregation":"first","window":{"kind":"timeOfDay","from":"00:00","to":"12:00"},"label":"First weigh-in before noon"}],"formulas":[{"id":"trend","kind":"movingAverage","of":"a","points":7,"label":"7-day rolling average"}],"bucket":"day","range":"M","chart":{"style":"dots"}}
